    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are your town's last line of defense in this unique Deck-Refiner roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Strigoi Town, you are the last Alchemist who still masters the ancient art of <strong>card fusion</strong>. As waves of vampires descend upon your village, only your potions can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft your starting deck</strong>, face relentless enemies, and <strong>combine your cards</strong> to craft increasingly powerful and unpredictable potions. Experiment, refine, and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on depth over scale, <strong>Strigoi Town</strong> offers short, focused runs (<strong>15 to 20 minutes)\u00a0</strong>and a tightly designed card pool \u2014 no hundreds of cards here, just <strong>meaningful choices</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.poster.avif?t=1755766991\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique card fusion system</strong> \u2013 Mix your potions to discover new abilities and hidden effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/94a3b0944df77c078123a30679679e55.poster.avif?t=1755766991\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/94a3b0944df77c078123a30679679e55.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/94a3b0944df77c078123a30679679e55.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Carefully draft your starting deck and adapt it with each encounter, as your opponent will steal one of the remaining cards every time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/1634273968816bdcfb39b37a21a561bc.poster.avif?t=1755766991\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/1634273968816bdcfb39b37a21a561bc.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/1634273968816bdcfb39b37a21a561bc.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based combat</strong> \u2013 Survive escalating battles against ever-stronger vampire foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/db7feaa9c11943664c64781e3b71cda8.poster.avif?t=1755766991\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/db7feaa9c11943664c64781e3b71cda8.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/db7feaa9c11943664c64781e3b71cda8.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and training</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your skills, unlock new cards, and grow stronger with each fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment. Fuse. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi Town is a challenging deckbuilding game, designed for players seeking a short but intense gameplay loop where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your village lies in your hands\u2026 and your flasks.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are your town's last line of defense in this unique Deck-Refiner roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Strigoi Town, you are the last Alchemist who still masters the ancient art of <strong>card fusion</strong>. As waves of vampires descend upon your village, only your potions can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft your starting deck</strong>, face relentless enemies, and <strong>combine your cards</strong> to craft increasingly powerful and unpredictable potions. Experiment, refine, and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on depth over scale, <strong>Strigoi Town</strong> offers short, focused runs (<strong>15 to 20 minutes)\u00a0</strong>and a tightly designed card pool \u2014 no hundreds of cards here, just <strong>meaningful choices</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.poster.avif?t=1755766991\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/b92de7b2368a706f4f1af35131dced94.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique card fusion system</strong> \u2013 Mix your potions to discover new abilities and hidden effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt