c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/db7feaa9c11943664c64781e3b71cda8.webm?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745540/extras/db7feaa9c11943664c64781e3b71cda8.mp4?t=1755766991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and training</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your skills, unlock new cards, and grow stronger with each fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment. Fuse. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi Town is a challenging deckbuilding game, designed for players seeking a short but intense gameplay loop where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of your village lies in your hands\u2026 and your flasks.</p>",
